OL,3,GNEWSAFlood victim, 95, lived in
OL,4,AWetherspoons until she died after her
OL,5,Ahome was destroyed
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen neighbours hammered on Jean
OL,8,FPowell's door and evacuated her to
OL,9,Fsafety because the nearby river had
OL,10,Fburst its banks and swamped her town,
OL,11,Flittle did she know she would never
OL,12,Freturn home.
OL,14,FJean sought a 10-month refuge at her
OL,15,Flocal Wetherspoons but kept asking when
OL,16,Fshe could go back to her flat, which
OL,17,Fwas flooded when the River Monnow hit
OL,18,F18-times its normal level in south
OL,19,FWales in November 2025.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
