OL,3,GNEWSAFlood victim, 95, lived in
OL,4,AWetherspoons until she died after her
OL,5,Ahome was destroyed
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut the 95-year-old never got to go
OL,8,Fback home and died in September - one
OL,9,Fof those who suffered a personal toll
OL,10,Ffrom the effects of being flooded.
OL,12,F"Jean used to say, when am I going
OL,13,Fhome?" said friend and neighbour Wyn
OL,14,FSmith. "All she wanted to do was come
OL,15,Fback home and we couldn't fulfil that."
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
